      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MOONLIGHT NELLIE (5) showed good early speed and led throughout to score by a space when a 7 length winner at this track over 512m (29.47). Has a good record at this journey. Got the money at her only try from this box. Well placed and will be tough to beat. KIA KEEPING (1) had been racing in honest fashion recording two placings in a row before finishing sixth (29.92) at this track latest. Form at the trip sound including nine wins. Boasts a strong record from this draw with seven wins and two minor placings from 12 starts. Key player if finds best. HIGH COBBER (3) goes very well here starting nine times for three wins and four minors. Placed last time (30.04) at this track in a Grade 4/5, finishing third and beaten 8 lengths. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. JUST JOHNNIE (7) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
